    <title>
      <narrative xml:lang="en">Feasibility Study - Connectivity Pilot and Feasibility Study in Eastern Democratic Republic of the Congo, through Enterprise - United States Unknown</narrative>
    </title>
    <description type="1">
      <narrative xml:lang="en">This grant to Global Broadband Solutions SARL funds a feasibility study and pilot project that would assess the economic and technical viability of an end-to-end LTE connectivity solution for data services delivered over satellite and fixed wireless technology in the Democratic Republic of the Congo. California-based cellular network solutions provider Ukama, Inc. is the sole-source Contractor for the Study.</narrative>
    </description>
